WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.850
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.160
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.330
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.150
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:53.320
Someone once said...

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:58.900
There is the finest tempura flour,

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:03.700
light and fluffy yet crispy...

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:19.980
Tembackflipura created by 
Nana Mizuki-san of Tokyo!

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:19.520
And after it's dipped, the tempura does 
a backflip right onto the plate...

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:24.020
Tembackflipura!

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.330
With a head like a fist,

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:33.300
and a tail like an open palm,

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.840
there are tropical fish that 
engage in rock-paper-scissors...

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:44.710
Rockpaperfish created by 
Ryotaro Okiayu of Tokyo!

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:44.710
Rockpaperfish!

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:49.650
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:54.790
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:03.900
The Four-Beasts awoke in the Gourmet 
World and attacked the Human World.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:12.540
Gripped by terror, humans 
desperately evacuated.

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:24.380
We shall protect the Human World!

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:27.420
Now is the time to show them the might

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:30.660
of modern weapons created 
by human intelligence!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:43.700
But the military forces of the human race 
weren't able to stop the Four-Beasts.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:00.550
Huh? I can't see its shadow of death.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:02.150
At least not at this moment...

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.990
Disgusting!

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.730
Disgusting! Disgusting!

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.500
What is it?! Gross!

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:18.170
You stay outta this, Daruma Horse.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:21.570
It's <i>my</i> playtime.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.380
Alright. You wanna rumble?

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:31.880
However, Fang King's Capture Level is 127.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:36.290
And Invite Death's Capture Level is 140.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.890
King Octopus Kong's Capture Level is 137.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:43.360
All of their levels turned out 
to be much higher than expected.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:55.740
We could be in big trouble unless 
we go after this guy seriously.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:01.480
Will Toriko and the rest of the Four 
Kings be able to stop the Four-Beasts?

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:26.200
Toriko, Coco, Sunny, Zebra! The 
Four Kings' Storming Onslaught!

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.040
Toriko-san...

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.320
36-fold...

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.660
...Twin Spiked Punch!

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:09.110
Its Capture Level may be 127,

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:10.780
but so friggin' what?!

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.120
My poison isn't working.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.260
There is no creature in the Human World

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.260
with that many antibodies.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.660
So these are the Four-Beasts...

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.180
Kiss!

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.780
Dissolving poison...

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:55.890
Poison Armor!

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:58.200
Poison Sword!

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.330
Disgusting!

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:39.340
Super Spatula!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.720
Those octopus tentacles 
are pretty damn powerful!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:55.350
And they're way too big!

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:56.850
That's gross too!

00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:01.730
But the most revolting 
thing is its toughness.

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.970
300,000 strand...

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.470
...Hair Punch!

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:23.280
Disgusting...

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:49.410
So ya spit out magma missiles, huh?

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:51.480
You're one cocky turtle.

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.820
But if we're talkin' missiles...

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:00.050
This is how you fire 'em off!

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:03.250
Voice Missile!

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:18.340
That's Toriko, all right! 
We're counting on you!

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.840
Show 'em, Coco!

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.210
Sunny! Zebra!

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.040
Keep it up!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:24.810
Go! Go!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.780
Four Kings!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:36.190
As expected of the Four 
Kings Gourmet Hunters.

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:41.430
But the Four-Beasts won't die so easily.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:10.290
This guy's gettin' even more powerful!

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.400
Toriko!

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:32.440
D-Disgusting!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:38.950
Hair Lock!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.830
How strong is this thing?!

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:06.610
What's this?

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.110
Kiss!

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:50.690
Oh, no!

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:53.390
I can't dodge all of that!

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.750
It can't be...

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.070
I don't believe it!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.670
The Four Kings...

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.110
Seriously?!

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.580
They were overcome?

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:47.850
Then we're done for!

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.110
It's over!

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.180
No, it isn't!

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:53.920
It'll be okay.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:56.750
There's no way the Four Kings would lose.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.030
Toriko!

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:39.800
The Four-Beasts' Fang King, a Beast King...

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:43.770
Even those fangs and claws of fury you got

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.940
can't hurt me one bit

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:49.870
'cause I've mastered Honoring the Food!

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.280
Toriko-san!

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.280
Toriko!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:06.860
You sure like to make a big 
damn splash for a turtle.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:10.230
Your cockiness don't got no bounds. {sic}

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:16.530
So I'll make a big splash of my own!

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.550
Bastard!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.690
That hurt my cuticles.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.000
Poison Doll.

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:48.630
Too bad.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:51.600
It was just a mock-up of 
me made out of poison.

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.140
It's not over!

00:14:58.140 --> 00:14:59.610
That's the Four Kings for you!

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.680
See, everyone?!

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:04.720
Did you really think the Four 
Kings would go down so easily?

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:08.690
I'm sure those four will save the world!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.030
Rin-san?

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:22.200
I want to do something to help.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.500
The president's message...

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.900
Zebra turned it off before it was over.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:29.970
Maybe there's a hint in there about 
how to defeat the Four-Beasts!

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.080
Oh, that's right!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.980
There are two things I forgot to say.

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.090
This thing...

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.160
It means to eat away at the whole continent!

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:24.430
Perfect!

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.460
Why so surprised?

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:59.760
Is this the first time you've had an 
opponent who's immune to your poison?

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.370
I made antibodies, see.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:06.570
And this is my evolved Poison Armor, 
thanks to Honoring the Food.

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:11.040
Now I'm able to produce completely 
different kinds of poison too.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.980
In fact, let me show you a 
poison I've kept in reserve.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:19.880
Queen!

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:37.000
Alright.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:38.670
And yet...

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:42.370
It puts out tons of tentacles.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.380
So I suppose I'll have to match it.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:50.010
Have you reached your maximum 
number of tentacles?

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:53.180
After learning Honoring the Food, 
the number of hairs I have...

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.750
...is one million!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.590
Incidentally, the width 
of my dining room-kitchen

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:02.330
is 300 meters.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.800
So, come in.

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:09.830
And in that instant, you'll become 
the carp on my cutting board.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.570
Octopus, I mean.

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:15.170
Or gorilla?

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:20.510
Voice Burst!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:40.530
Playtime is just about over.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.230
Get down here!

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.780
Voice Meteor Shower!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.160
There's still somethin' missin'!

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:09.590
Yeah, a cocky bastard that's 
in the throes of death...

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:14.370
...needs to be finished off with fists!

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.270
Okay.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.310
Here's where we really get to it.

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:24.880
How about I show you my new skills,

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:28.480
gained through Honoring the 
Food and following intuition?

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:34.120
Oh, that's right!

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:36.390
There are two things I forgot to say.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:40.090
Actually, the Four-Beasts aren't four Beasts.

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:43.160
They're one!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.730
One creature, the main body,

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:52.470
sends these four Beasts to the Human World.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:57.440
In other words, they're no more than 
the arms and legs of the Four-Beasts.

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:00.880
Every time, their strength differs,

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.280
but their Capture Level 
is usually around 100.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:09.350
There's one other thing 
that's even more important.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:11.720
Actually...

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:16.060
...there's someone in the shadows 
controlling the actual Four-Beasts.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.930
The mastermind who truly 
needs to be taken down

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.230
is him!

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.040
Is this...

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:29.810
...for real?

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:06.240
I have been alone

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:13.650
Ever since that day

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:21.390
All I got was a definite history

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:28.030
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:31.770
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:35.170
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:38.940
A dream is still a dream

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:42.580
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:46.350
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:49.920
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:57.430
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:03.900
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:08.670
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:14.150
Hiding Level 8

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:12.040
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 8.

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.150
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:17.180
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:22.650
Well, it's the Gourmet 
Coliseum. Do you know it?

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:25.590
Now where could Yun be?

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:30.460
Yun is... right here!

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:38.600
How was it?

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:41.470
Yun is really good at hiding, isn't he?

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:43.780
When my supervisor is on the warpath,

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:46.810
I wish I could hide somewhere 
like Yun 'til he cools off.

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:49.310
And now on to the next segment!

00:22:52.210 --> 00:22:53.420
Maximum aura!

00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:55.900
The Four Kings show off their true power with new techniques!

00:22:55.900 --> 00:22:58.020
Will this mean the defeat of the Four-Beasts? Or...?!

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:01.690
Toriko's New Crisis! The Creeping Main Body of the Four-Beasts!

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:03.680
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
